Parameters: @{triggerBody()?['ParametersJson']}
Requested by: @{coalesce(triggerOutputs()?['headers']?['x-ms-user-email'], triggerBody()?['RequestedBy'], 'IT Admin Assistant agent')}

Only roles on the allow-list can be assigned, scoped to the administrative unit.
Nothing changes unless you approve.

Action: RemoveRole
Parameters: @{triggerBody()?['ParametersJson']}
Requested by: @{coalesce(triggerOutputs()?['headers']?['x-ms-user-email'], triggerBody()?['RequestedBy'], 'IT Admin Assistant agent')}

Only allow-listed roles can be removed.
Nothing changes unless you approve.

Action: RevokeSessions
Parameters: @{triggerBody()?['ParametersJson']}
Requested by: @{coalesce(triggerOutputs()?['headers']?['x-ms-user-email'], triggerBody()?['RequestedBy'], 'IT Admin Assistant agent')}

All refresh tokens and session cookies are revoked.
Nothing changes unless you approve.

Action: DisableUser
Parameters: @{triggerBody()?['ParametersJson']}
Requested by: @{coalesce(triggerOutputs()?['headers']?['x-ms-user-email'], triggerBody()?['RequestedBy'], 'IT Admin Assistant agent')}

The user can no longer sign in.
Nothing changes unless you approve.

Action: OffboardUser
Parameters: @{triggerBody()?['ParametersJson']}
Requested by: @{coalesce(triggerOutputs()?['headers']?['x-ms-user-email'], triggerBody()?['RequestedBy'], 'IT Admin Assistant agent')}

Block sign-in, revoke sessions, remove changeable groups and direct licences. Nothing is deleted.
Nothing changes unless you approve.
